{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hide and Seek in a Ruined Building at Night</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Game Overview \u2013 \u201cKAKURENBO: Hide and Seek\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cKAKURENBO: Hide and Seek\u201d is a <strong>first-person 3D horror adventure game</strong> illustrated in a unique <strong>2.5D hand-drawn art style</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as a young elementary school student exploring an <strong>eerie, abandoned building</strong> on the outskirts of a small Japanese town.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae Genre</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D horror adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-person perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Light puzzle-solving elements</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcd6 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, the protagonist is invited by friends to turn an old, abandoned building on the edge of town into a \u201csecret base.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, the friends who started the game of hide and seek <strong>never come back</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alone in the dark and musty ruins, you\u2019ll slowly begin to sense that something else is lurking within these halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to make it back home safely?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd0d Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-drawn illustrations come to life</strong> in a distinctive 2.5D style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First-person perspective</strong> for an immersive and claustrophobic experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ambient sounds and unsettling silence</strong> that steadily heighten the tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Light puzzles</strong> suitable for newcomers to horror games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Four different endings</strong> to uncover</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd52 Estimated Playtime</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 minutes to 1 hour</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcfa Distribution Policy Summary</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Streaming is allowed for both individuals and corporations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If possible, please include the game name and store page URL in the description.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No prior permission is required.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3762450?t=1748942591","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3762450?t=1748942591","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762450/01fa1286e5e7986f0b8f08f33ff030168720d0a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748942591","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762450/01fa1286e5e7986f0b8f08f33ff030168720d0a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748942591","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains the following mature content:\r\n- Blood\r\n- Death"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hide and Seek in a Ruined Building at Night</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Game Overview \u2013 \u201cKAKURENBO: Hide and Seek\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cKAKURENBO: Hide and Seek\u201d is a <strong>first-person 3D horror adventure game</strong> illustrated in a unique <strong>2.5D hand-drawn art style</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as a young elementary school student exploring an <strong>eerie, abandoned building</strong> on the outskirts of a small Japanese town.</p><h2 